<Positioned left="48" top="20"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5EEAD4FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">A17 · 01 · 调用契约</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="92"><Text fontSize="34" color="#0F172AFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">从文本到图片：一次真实调用</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="140"><Text fontSize="24" color="#475569FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">请求体、响应体与错误分支只有一条规则：成功是图片字节，失败是 JSON。</Text></Positioned>
